---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Keep a promise from a message you sent, due at a time, so it comes back when due. Adding it again moves the date

Usage: mxr commitments add [OPTIONS] --what <WHAT> --due <DUE> <MESSAGE_ID>

Arguments:
  <MESSAGE_ID>  The sent message the promise is in

Options:
      --what <WHAT>      What you promised, such as "send the deck"
      --due <DUE>        When it is due: "fri", "tomorrow 9am", "in 3d" or RFC3339
      --dry-run          Show what would be kept without storing it
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
